  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LOCAGRI Rice Production and Market Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LOCAGRI processes and markets its rice under the Locariz brand to local Ivorians consumers. LOCAGRI seeks to expand the range of services it provides to paddy producers to include tilling, threshing and drying services, to improve its ability to dry and process larger quantities of paddy, and to implement a marketing strategy to capture a larger portion of the local luxury rice market.</narrative>
  </description>
